{{also|Jaffa}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{m|en|Jaffa}}, an ancient port city in Israel from which the oranges were exported. The sense "impotent male" is a reference to being "seedless"; see {{m|en|seed}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-au-jaffa.ogg|Audio (AU)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A type of sweet orange, normally seedless.
# {{lb|en|slang}} An impotent or infertile male.
# {{lb|en|cricket}} A [[ball]] that is very [[difficult]] for the [[batsman]] to [[hit]] because it moves [[erratically]] either through the [[air]] or off the [[pitch]]

